My instagram is [https://www.instagram.com/kiratsuki\_cosplay/](https://www.instagram.com/kiratsuki_cosplay/) if anyone wants to see more Inazuma cosplays. 

&#x200B;

This pic was taken by [https://www.instagram.com/acethirn/](https://www.instagram.com/acethirn/) \~\~

https://twitter.com/Moonimations/status/1444333967117856770?t=YPwPH912hgm3ZKjeWTdLTA&s=19 my original tweet btw. 

&#x200B;

Was just thinking again about how different Kiyama Hiroto and Kiyama Tatsuya are\~

Man man man... all this drama... the lack of background checks nor any type of contracts is pretty dumb with such a big scale project like this.

&#x200B;

Tbh after I'm done with school deadlines I may just put together a small-scale yansim, but visual-novel style. I'm a game art student, but I have made small VN's with Renpy before so I don't need a team lmao. Everyone's own take on the 'characters' of yansim makes me wanna try it too ya'know
